                                "sense_id": "50d8fa5a-5c85-31ac-995c-1ce01695f38c",
                                "text": "[...] recently attempted to explain the origin of the Ukrainian form buty, etc., in another way, i.e., through the labiovelarizing influence of the l closing the syllable (resulting from the non- palatalized l)."
