                                "sense_id": "50d8fa5a-5c85-31ac-995c-1ce01695f38c",
                                "text": "It is usually defined as a process whereby front vowels consonantalize (palatalize) to the semivowel /j/ when followed by certain other vowels [...] or whereby back vowels consonantalize (labiovelarize) to the semivowel /w/ [...]"
